{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐冠軍黃嘉雯（Carmaney）憑著高挑身材與知性優雅氣質深受觀眾喜愛。她不時透過社交平台分享生活近況，日前更於IG限時動態大方公開了兩張極具年代感的珍貴童年寫真照，與網民分享她小時候初次面對鏡頭的可愛模樣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e441cbf4-0a5a-48da-ad2b-5e85574f7522.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026qYe4SIP0xI1784630153.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e441cbf4-0a5a-48da-ad2b-5e85574f7522.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">從照片可見，年幼時期的黃嘉雯五官已十分精緻，她戴上珍珠髮箍，身穿紫色馬甲外衣，雙手交疊倚靠在黑色椅背上。其流暢的面部輪廓與如今幾乎如出一轍，從小便是個標準的美人胚子。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6c0ce80e-2794-4991-9000-dcbff6f1ecfc.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wxje7hox7C1784630159.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6c0ce80e-2794-4991-9000-dcbff6f1ecfc.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一張照片更顯夢幻，她換上一套宛如小公主般的白色喱士連身裙，頭戴白色羽毛頭飾，手拉裙擺並將身體微微向前傾，對著鏡頭露出靦腆笑容，充滿童趣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c51bc486-b452-4300-9ad7-3b03dd04b2d7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026GrYxciEax81784630165.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c51bc486-b452-4300-9ad7-3b03dd04b2d7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">黃嘉雯透露，這些照片是當年媽媽帶她去拍攝的人生第一輯影樓寫真。看著滿臉稚氣的自己，她也忍不住幽默感嘆：「當年笑都唔識，諗都冇諗過而家竟然每日都對住鏡頭。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T01:10:49.020755+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}